{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "88e8a0b31c8cb4ab56227e931726a3914d7f423fcc6c8deb7d7d4264ac4ddd05", "ja": "（亜美のウェスタン風ライブが終わった。\nお客さん達もノリノリで、楽しいステージだったな）", "zh": "（亚美的西部风格演唱会结束了。\n观众也都兴致勃勃，是场很开心的表演呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "03742b1becf3197879c353d962e9a5e4d8fc6e2222edaa6fda4bf0d97938f983", "ja": "兄ちゃん兄ちゃん！\n今日の亜美、サイコーだったっしょ？", "zh": "大哥哥大哥哥！\n今天的亚美，超棒的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1002_p", "source_sha256": "06ded25688b184da26eb0665d3b2a25957c79f3e4ca719b36cbf8dca1618ace1", "ja": "ああ！　いつにも増して、客席との一体感が\n凄かったな。俺もびっくりしたよ。", "zh": "是啊！比起往常，跟观众席的一体感又更强了呢。\n连我都吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "fd982e4136c88fd81387e6ad656e698aaaf874b19f0dbb7ffdc885060fcc8646", "ja": "やっぱね～♪　じつは亜美、今回はメッチャ\n頑張ったんだ！　トックンとかもしたし～♪", "zh": "果然是这样～♪\n其实亚美这次超级努力的！还做了特训～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0a16e88d883c25cdc48b167c3cb7ea39d12054f4b8b9edea6f57d64fb2c11dd", "ja": "えっ、特訓？　へえ、それは知らなかった。\nどんなことしたんだ？", "zh": "咦，特训？是喔，我都不知道。\n你做了怎么样的特训啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "a88231b78241439361e6737d02e995256b7bf1b71972c2148e422231442a6945", "ja": "えっとね、今回は亜美がウェスタン風のウェイトレス！\nっていうライブだったっしょ？　だからー。", "zh": "就是啊，这次是「亚美当西部风格的服务生！」\n这种主题的演唱会对吧？所以啊──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "98187c6efca5aa2ee9fb9e93aa8bf88a8693f344aaeb433625d3afc61719fa4c", "ja": "みなりんちのお店を、いっぱいお手伝いしたんだ！", "zh": "亚美就去美奈奈家开的店，帮了很多忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1007_p", "source_sha256": "203e8d6840ebe8f17b5394cd1e1573a1ebec4a87c525cc8c94efc8eea0d399b7", "ja": "みなりん……あ、美奈子のお店？　佐竹飯店か？", "zh": "美奈奈……啊，美奈子的店？佐竹饭店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "345d4e7889b07d1234430f13b739433b907332a65f5874f6ef688e7eaa81f28e", "ja": "そそ！　看板ムスメになって料理はこんだりー、\n食べたり焦がしたりー、メッチャ活躍したんだよ！", "zh": "对对！亚美有当招牌女郎还有送餐～\n又是偷吃又是烧焦～超级活跃的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4a27e53a4fa29c58abd97f4caa45befbcbd76d182b73c1941fd6b9c4569f2d50", "ja": "そ、そうなのか？\n後半はあまり活躍してなかったような……？", "zh": "是、是吗？\n后半听起来好像不太活跃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "14c90639114af279ca45049bd8edd60d76b391f1f3850003cc6c6e78bb87e0be", "ja": "したの～！　みなりんも、また来てねって言って\nくれたし！　ごはんも毎日ゴチソウしてくれたし！", "zh": "明明就有～！美奈奈还欢迎亚美下次再去！\n而且还每天都请亚美吃饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "895a065afe2d15a9f115e13f5fc114abe7a106da30ca9a0b791c334d73007f94", "ja": "そ、そうか……美奈子にはお礼を言わないとな。\nでも、手伝いとライブは、そもそも関係ないような？", "zh": "是、是吗……我得去向美奈子道谢才行。\n不过，去帮忙和演唱会好像没什么关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "575239bbaf9f11b606cda04c4526e02c6ebb244c02345cce5e4c00af785000eb", "ja": "甘いよ兄ちゃん。杏仁ドーフより甘いよ！\n虫歯に注意した方がいいよ！", "zh": "太嫩了大哥哥，比杏仁豆腐还嫩！\n劝你要小心蛀牙喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "af9eeb68e0633a3edef523d24b3bfadd3fc32b0f73c76ad506ef3e473e999a85", "ja": "亜美は今回のトックンで、ライブでメッチャ大事な\nウェイトレスの極意を学んだんだかんね！", "zh": "亚美可是透过这次特训，学到了对演唱会来说，\n超级重要的服务生真髓喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cc271e98938dd59a3fec8e9ae85a1129ed4f7b86e05a1614b4e34850c9226f96", "ja": "ウェイトレスの極意！？　それは一体……？", "zh": "服务生真髓！？那到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "4b831d710be0e235b01d69ba5bf43c324a65da2896c35bd158fbd2e9ad054659", "ja": "それは、オモテナシの心じゃよ！\nウラがあってもオモテナシ！", "zh": "那就是真诚接待的心啊！\n真情收费，诚实接待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dbbfc0222aa2f998f41f57088c6a9952d643ddbefe28b569881cb0a470db5f2c", "ja": "おお……！\nで、どういうことだ？", "zh": "哦哦……！\n所以是怎么一回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "9497ffe4ed6f5e482b6f8585375ae889d6b7e7a1325cefaee0b333a027c9999a", "ja": "だから、んっとね。亜美は今日のライブ、\nオモテナシの心で頑張ったんだー。", "zh": "所以说，那个啊，亚美在今天的演唱会中，\n用真诚接待的心来努力表演了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "c6b366fe847a86719af99c81b6490746c3222142ca494d162a0cb4d33e4cdab0", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ、ゴチューモンどうぞーって感じで！\n餃子一丁、お待たせーって感じで！", "zh": "欢迎光临，请点餐～这种感觉！\n饺子一盘久等了～这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "f99e7f6d1384a87680a09066eda52e35335de5087155a6e1c108b6f9fbf70fda", "ja": "そしたらね、ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃんたちが、\n待ってたよって……喜んでくれてる気がしたんだよー♪", "zh": "然后啊，粉丝的大哥哥、大姊姊们就说，\n「等你很久了」……感觉大家很开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5a26f5748f72f354df5c3f62c7b3c0264b08c3979795ef1539681e6f1b50f32e", "ja": "そうだったのか……なるほどな。\n歓迎する気持ちに、注文を聞く気持ち……。", "zh": "是这样啊……原来如此。\n欢迎的心情，还有接受点餐的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f84dba06d9af07cf577d9f17fac6ce10dfb9b03a244bd4bcc40fcc9bd4902161", "ja": "うん、それは確かに、\nいい特訓だったのかもしれない。", "zh": "嗯，那确实是个很好的特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "c0783c9f897da56135a91fd8a892638138ef41baed6f0dc9bab2c0519ba0aefb", "ja": "でっしょー？\nやっぱ亜美のトックンは、バッチリンコだったよね！", "zh": "对吧～？\n亚美的特训果然「完美无雀」没错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "a8b0445fc1d173a8f59a744d0e762cf707d2c113112199a351be68cb44c3c242", "ja": "ってことで、亜美はまたトックンに行ってくるよ～！\n後はよろしくね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "所以说，亚美要再去特训啰～！\n之后就交给你了，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "3e82e9933322d40deaefdafc12276d733bfe3c901b1d9213ff32cffb7600e102", "ja": "みなりーん、どこ～？\n亜美、お腹すいちゃったよ～！", "zh": "美奈奈～你在哪～？\n亚美肚子饿了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0074_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bcd8ef805d4ffdd94f1cad75709cfb2bdbcad36428a9e7e24aff7fd3f788817e", "ja": "（ときに思いもよらない方法で、結果を出す……。\n亜美こそ、アイドル界の開拓者なのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（偶尔会用别人想都没想到的方法，来拿出成果……\n或许亚美正是偶像界的开拓者！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
